WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.660
Meet Dr Marit Osayande, Convenor of the Living Dashboard at Slop University.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.870
I worked in facilities at a transit authority.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.390
Our status board ran for years,

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.240
and no one was assigned to read it.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.969
Now I follow boards like that one,

00:00:17.169 --> 00:00:19.649
from the day they go up to the day nobody looks.

00:00:20.149 --> 00:00:22.425
I've studied them in childcare foyers,

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:24.275
outside service stations,

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:26.855
and at aged-care front desks.

00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:30.145
Her work is cited right across the University.

00:00:31.145 --> 00:00:33.655
One hundred and ninety-four research outputs.

00:00:33.955 --> 00:00:36.235
Nine hundred and twenty-one citations.

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:39.995
And three hundred and thirteen thousand dollars in research income.

00:00:40.795 --> 00:00:42.559
I love a good dashboard.

00:00:42.659 --> 00:00:45.817
But first, I read the little date in the corner.

00:00:46.817 --> 00:00:49.057
Read Dr Osayande's work on our website,

00:00:49.207 --> 00:00:50.287
find us on Bluesky,

00:00:50.437 --> 00:00:51.527
or send us an email.
